    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175150/extras/b5fef7bcf8f4b842741ebc12aeb0ae14.avif?t=1700917745\" /></div><br><br><strong>Ahoy sailors!</strong> Welcome to <strong>ARGH!</strong>, a 3D Battle Royale where you will have to come up with the best strategies to survive.<br><br>Navigate your boat skillfully and be ready to explore every nook and cranny of the map!<br>As you explore, collect and use wisely the various treasures of the seas to get rid of the opposing captains and build a solid reputation across the oceans!<br>However, watch out for the Oblivion! This scourge sweeps memories away and sinks unsuccessful captains into oblivion... So, raise your bounty to the highest level and build an unforgettable legend!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175150/extras/d937cacea70f4d067b68f6fee640ff67.avif?t=1700917745\" /></div><br><br>- Play as one of 3\u00a0unique captains of ARGH! and compete against 6\u00a0players in a resource-filled arena.<br><br>- Explore the various islands and loot their abundant treasures.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175150/extras/e796be2c5633695cc7c5a733ada9ff87.poster.avif?t=1700917745\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175150/extras/e796be2c5633695cc7c5a733ada9ff87.webm?t=1700917745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2175150/extras/e796be2c5633695cc7c5a733ada9ff87.mp4?t=1700917745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Use these treasures to attack other ships!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:/